  "body": "The source code for the definition of \"**autonomous** custom element\" looks like this:\r\n```\r\n<dfn data-export=\"\">autonomous custom element</dfn>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `data-export=\"\"` [allows other specs to link to the definition](https://github.com/whatwg/wattsi/blob/master/Syntax.md#exporting-definitions).\r\n\r\nThe source code for the definition of \"**form-associated** custom element\" does not have `data-export`:\r\n```\r\n<dfn>form-associated custom element</dfn>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI will provide a pr shortly to add `data-export`:\r\n```\r\n<dfn data-export=\"\">form-associated custom element</dfn>\r\n```",
